msgstr "wat is gebeur nou"

#: kmidi.cpp:681
msgid "select the next song randomly"
msgstr "kies die volgende liedjie lukraak"

#: kmidi.cpp:685
msgid ""
"open up or close<br>\n"
"the configuration window"
msgstr ""
"open begin of maak toe<br>\n"
"die opstelling venster"

#: kmidi.cpp:692
msgid "set playing time elapsed"
msgstr "stel speel tyd versteke"

#: kmidi.cpp:702
msgid "the current volume level"
msgstr "die huidige volume vlak"

#: kmidi.cpp:727 kmidi.cpp:1828 kmidi.cpp:1836
msgid "Song --/--"
msgstr "Liedjie --/--"

#: kmidi.cpp:735
msgid ""
"Adjust the volume here.<br>\n"
"(Keep it pretty low, and<br>\n"
"use <i>KMix</i> to adjust<br>\n"
"the mixer volumes, if<br>\n"
"you want it louder.)"
msgstr ""
"Verstel die volume hier.<br>\n"
"(Hou dit redelik lae, en<br>\n"
"gebruik <i>Kmix</i> na Verstel<br>\n"
"die menger volumes, as<br>\n"
"jy wil hê dit harder.)"

#: kmidi.cpp:746
msgid ""
"If playing, then pause.<br>\n"
"Otherwise start playing."
msgstr ""
"As speel, dan word pouseer.<br>\n"
"Andersins begin speel."

#: kmidi.cpp:752
msgid "Stop playing this song."
msgstr "Stop speel hierdie liedjie."

#: kmidi.cpp:755
msgid "Replay"
msgstr "Weerspeel"

#: kmidi.cpp:757
msgid ""
"Keep replaying<br>\n"
"the same song."
msgstr ""
"Hou herspeel<br>\n"
"die selfde liedjie."

#: kmidi.cpp:761
msgid "Bwd"
msgstr "Bwd"

#: kmidi.cpp:762
msgid ""
"Go backwards to play<br>\n"
"an earlier part of the song."
msgstr ""
"Gaan terugwaarts na speel<br>\n"
"'n vroeër deel van die liedjie."

#: kmidi.cpp:765
msgid "Fwd"
msgstr "Stuur aan"

#: kmidi.cpp:766
msgid ""
"Go forwards to play<br>\n"
"a later part of the song."
msgstr ""
"Gaan vorentoe na speel<br>\n"
"'n later deel van die liedjie."

#: kmidi.cpp:773
msgid "Prev"
msgstr "Vorige"

#: kmidi.cpp:774
msgid ""
"Play the previous song<br>\n"
"on the play list."
msgstr ""
"Speel die vorige liedjie<br>\n"
"op die Speel lys."

#: kmidi.cpp:778
msgid ""
"Play the next song<br>\n"
"on the play list."
msgstr ""
"Speel die volgende liedjie<br>\n"
"op die Speel lys."

#: kmidi.cpp:784
msgid ""
"These leds show<br>\n"
"the number of notes<br>\n"
"being played."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie liggies vertoon<br>\n"
"die nommer van notas<br>\n"
"te wees gespeel."

#: kmidi.cpp:797
msgid ""
"The <i>status</i> led is<br>\n"
"<b>red</b> when KMidi is<br>\n"
"stopped, <b>yellow</b> when<br>\n"
"paused, otherwise:<br>\n"
"<b>blue</b> when looping on<br>\n"
"the same song<br>\n"
"<b>magenta</b> when selecting<br>\n"
"songs randomly<br>\n"
"or <b>green</b> when KMidi is<br>\n"
"playing or ready to play."
msgstr ""
"Die <i>status</i> led is<br>\n"
"<b>rooi</b> wanneer Kmidi is<br>\n"
"op gehou, <b>geel</b> wanneer<br>\n"
"gepouseer, andersins:<br>\n"
"<b>blou</b> wanneer besig om te lus op<br>\n"
"Die selfde liedjie<br>\n"
"<b>magenta</b> wanneer deur te kies<br>\n"
"liedere lukraak<br>\n"
"of <b>groen</b> wanneer Kmidi is<br>\n"
"speel of gereed na speel."

#: kmidi.cpp:808
msgid ""
"The <i>loading</i> LED<br>\n"
"blinks <b>yellow</b> when<br>\n"
"patches are being<br>\n"
"loaded from the hard drive."
msgstr ""
"Die <i>laaiïng van</i> Led<br>\n"
"flikker <b>geel</b> wanneer<br>\n"
"lappe word te wees<br>\n"
"gelaai van Die hard dryf."

#: kmidi.cpp:813
msgid ""
"The <i>lyrics</i> LED<br>\n"
"lights up when a<br>\n"
"synchronized MIDI text<br>\n"
"event is being displayed<br>\n"
"in the <i>info</i> window."
msgstr ""
"Die <i>lirieke</i> Led<br>\n"
"gaan aan begin wanneer 'n<br>\n"
"gesinkroniseerde Midi teks<br>\n"
"gebeurtenis is te wees vertoon<br>\n"
"in Die <i>inligting</i> venster."

#: kmidi.cpp:819
msgid ""
"The <i>buffer</i> LED<br>\n"
"is orangeish when there is<br>\n"
"danger of a dropout, but<br>\n"
"greenish when all is ok."
msgstr ""
"Die <i>buffer</i> Led<br>\n"
"is oranjerig wanneer daar is<br>\n"
"gevaar van 'n uitval, maar<br>\n"
"groenerig wanneer alle is goed."

#: kmidi.cpp:824
msgid ""
"The <i>interpolation</i> LED<br>\n"
"is on when c-spline or<br>\n"
"LaGrange interpolation<br>\n"
"is being used for resampling."
msgstr ""
"Die <i>interpolasie</i> Led<br>\n"
"is op wanneer c-spline of<br>\n"
"Lagrange interpolasie<br>\n"
"is te wees gebruik word vir hermonstering."

#: kmidi.cpp:828
msgid ""
"The <i>echo</i> LED<br>\n"
"is on when KMidi is<br>\n"
"not too busy to generate<br>\n"
"extra echo notes<br>\n"
"for reverberation effect.<br>\n"
"It's bright when you've<br>\n"
"asked for extra reverberation."
msgstr ""
"Die <i>ego</i> Led<br>\n"
"is op wanneer Kmidi is<br>\n"
"nie te besig na genereer<br>\n"
"addisionele ego notas<br>\n"
"vir reverberation effek.<br>\n"
"Dit is helder wanneer jy het<br>\n"
"gevra vir addisionele reverberation."

#: kmidi.cpp:835
msgid ""
"The <i>detune</i> LED<br>\n"
"is on when KMidi is<br>\n"
"not too busy to generate<br>\n"
"extra detuned notes<br>\n"
"for chorusing effect.<br>\n"
"It's bright when you've<br>\n"
"asked for extra chorusing."
msgstr ""
"Die <i>ontstem</i> Led<br>\n"
"is op wanneer Kmidi is<br>\n"
"nie te besig na genereer<br>\n"
"addisionele ontstem notas<br>\n"
"vir koor effek.<br>\n"
"Dit is helder wanneer jy het<br>\n"
"gevra vir addisionele koor."

#: kmidi.cpp:845
msgid "ichecks"
msgstr "ichecks"

#: kmidi.cpp:852
msgid "Resample using linear interpolation."
msgstr "Hermonster te gebruik liniêre interpolasie."

#: kmidi.cpp:853
msgid "Resample using c-spline interpolation."
msgstr "Hermonster te gebruik c-spline interpolasie."

#: kmidi.cpp:854
msgid "Resample using LaGrange interpolation."
msgstr "Hermonster te gebruik Lagrange interpolasie."

#: kmidi.cpp:855
msgid ""
"Resample using c-spline<br>\n"
"interpolation with<br>\n"
"the low pass filter."
msgstr ""
"Hermonster te gebruik c-spline<br>\n"
"interpolasie met<br>\n"
"die lae herhaling filter."

#: kmidi.cpp:865
msgid ""
"The display shows notes<br>\n"
" being played on the<br>\n"
"16 or 32 MIDI channels."
msgstr ""
"Die vertoon vertoon notas<br>\n"
" te wees gespeel op Die<br>\n"
"16 of 32 Midi kanale."

#: kmidi.cpp:887
msgid ""
"Here is information<br>\n"
"extracted from the MIDI<br>\n"
"file currently being played."
msgstr ""
"Hier is informasie<br>\n"
"uitgepak van die Midi<br>\n"
"lêer huidiglik te wees gespeel."

#: kmidi.cpp:901
msgid ""
"Choose a patchset.<br>\n"
"(You can add patchsets by<br>\n"
"downloading them from somewhere<br>\n"
"and editing the file<br>\n"
"$KDEDIR/share/apps/kmidi/<br>\n"
"config/timidity.cfg .)"
msgstr ""
"Kies 'n lapstel.<br>\n"
"(Jy kan voeg deur lapstelle deur<br>\n"
"aflaaiïng hulle van êrens<br>\n"
"en redigering die lêer<br>\n"
"$Kdedir/deel/programme/kmidi/<br>\n"
"opstelling/timidity.cfg .)"

#: kmidi.cpp:922
msgid ""
"Select a MIDI file<br>\n"
"to play from this<br>\n"
"play list."
msgstr ""
"Kies 'n Midi lêer<br>\n"
"na speel van hierdie<br>\n"
"speel lys."

#: kmidi.cpp:931
msgid ""
"These are the playlist files<br>\n"
"you've created using<br>\n"
" the <i>playlist editor</i>.<br>\n"
"Click on one, and its<br>\n"
"contents will replace<br>\n"
"the play list above."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie word die liedjielys lêers<br>\n"
"jy het geskep te gebruik<br>\n"
" die <i>liedjielys redigeerder</i>.<br>\n"
"Kliek op een, en sy<br>\n"
"inhoud sal vervang<br>\n"
"die speel lys boonste."

#: kmidi.cpp:971
msgid ""
"There are three settings:<br>\n"
"<b>off</b> for no extra stereo notes<br>\n"
"<b>no change</b> for normal stereo<br>\n"
"<b>checked/on</b> for notes panned<br>\n"
"left and right artificially"
msgstr ""
"Daar word drie instellings:<br>\n"
"<b>af</b> vir nee addisionele stereo notas<br>\n"
"<b>nee verander</b> vir normale stereo<br>\n"
"<b>nagegaan/op</b> vir notas oorvloei<br>\n"
"links en regterkant kunsmatig"

#: kmidi.cpp:976
msgid ""
"There are three settings:<br>\n"
"<b>off</b> for no extra echo notes<br>\n"
"<b>no change</b> for echoing<br>\n"
"when a patch specifies<br>\n"
"reverberation<br>\n"
"<b>checked/on</b> for added reverb<br>\n"
"for all instruments"
msgstr ""
"Daar word drie instellings:<br>\n"
"<b>af</b> vir nee addisionele ego notas<br>\n"
"<b>nee verander</b> vir egoes<br>\n"
"wanneer 'n lap spesifiseer<br>\n"
"reverberation<br>\n"
"<b>nagegaan/op</b> vir bygevoeg reverb<br>\n"
"vir alle instrumente"

#: kmidi.cpp:982
msgid ""
"There are three settings:<br>\n"
"<b>off</b> for no extra detuned notes<br>\n"
"<b>no change</b> for detuned notes<br>\n"
"when a patch specifies<br>\n"
"chorusing<br>\n"
"<b>checked/on</b> for added chorusing<br>\n"
"for all instruments"
msgstr ""
"Daar word drie instellings:<br>\n"
"<b>af</b> vir nee addisionele ontstem notas<br>\n"
"<b>nee verander</b> vir ontstem notas<br>\n"
"wanneer 'n lap spesifiseer<br>\n"
"koor<br>\n"
"<b>nagegaan/op</b> vir bygevoeg koor<br>\n"
"vir alle instrumente"

#: kmidi.cpp:988
msgid ""
"There are three settings:<br>\n"
"<b>off</b> for only name and lyrics<br>\n"
"shown in the <i>info</i> window<br>\n"
"<b>no change</b> for all text<br>\n"
"messages to be shown<br>\n"
"<b>checked/on</b> to also display<br>\n"
"information about patches<br>\n"
"as they are loaded from disk"
msgstr ""
"Daar word drie instellings:<br>\n"
"<b>af</b> vir slegs naam en lirieke<br>\n"
"vertoon in die <i>inligting</i> venster<br>\n"
"<b>nee verander</b> vir alle teks<br>\n"
"boodskappe na wees vertoon<br>\n"
"<b>nagegaan/op</b> na asook vertoon<br>\n"
"informasie aangaande lappe<br>\n"
"as hulle word gelaai van disket"

#: kmidi.cpp:1001
msgid ""
"When this button is down,<br>\n"
"filters are used for the<br>\n"
"<i>MIDI</i> channel effects:<br>\n"
"<b>chorus</b>, <b>reverberation</b>,<br>\n"
"<b>celeste</b> and <b>phaser</b>.<br>\n"
"When it is off, <b>chorus</b> is<br>\n"
"applied instead with extra detuned<br>\n"
"notes, and <b>reverberation</b> is<br>\n"
"applied with echo notes, but<br>\n"
"the other effects are not applied."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer hierdie knoppie is ondertoe,<br>\n"
"filters word gebruik word vir die<br>\n"
"<i>Midi</i> kanaal effekte:<br>\n"
"<b>koor</b>, <b>reverberation</b>,<br>\n"
"<b>celeste</b> en <b>faser</b>.<br>\n"
"Wanneer dit is af, <b>koor</b> is<br>\n"
"aangewend in plaas van met addisionele ontstem<br>\n"
"notas, en <b>reverberation</b> is<br>\n"
"aangewend met ego notas, maar<br>\n"
"die ander effekte word nie aangewend."

#: kmidi.cpp:1019
msgid ""
"Use this to set the maximum<br>\n"
"notes that can be played<br>\n"
"at one time. Use a lower<br>\n"
"setting to avoid dropouts."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik hierdie na stel die maksimum<br>\n"
"notas wat kan wees gespeel<br>\n"
"na een tyd. Gebruik 'n sagter<br>\n"
"opset na vermy uitvalle."

#: kmidi.cpp:1035
msgid ""
"This setting is a delay,<br>\n"
"in hundredths of a second, before a played<br>\n"
"note is displayed on the<br>\n"
"channel meter to the left.<br>\n"
"It may help to synchronize the<br>\n"
"display with the music."
msgstr ""

#: kmidi.cpp:1046
msgid ""
"When this filter button<br>\n"
"is on, a low pass filter<br>\n"
"is used for drum patches<br>\n"
"when they are first loaded<br>\n"
"and when the patch itself<br>\n"
"requests this. The filter<br>\n"
"is also used for melodic voices<br>\n"
"if you have chosen the<br>\n"
"<i>c-spline+filter</i><br>\n"
"interpolation option."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer hierdie filter knoppie<br>\n"
