msgstr ""
"Oordra die huidige<br>\n"
"speel lys na die Liedjielys Redigeerder<br>\n"
"en begin dit begin."

#: kmidiframe.cpp:139
msgid "No Stereo Patch"
msgstr "Nee Stereo Lap"

#: kmidiframe.cpp:140
msgid ""
"Prevents playing the<br>\n"
"second instrument for those<br>\n"
"patches that have two<br>\n"
"(you probably don't want<br>\n"
"to choose this option)."
msgstr ""
"Voorkom speel die<br>\n"
"tweede instrument vir daardie<br>\n"
"lappe wat het twee<br>\n"
"(jy waarskynlik moet nie wil hê<br>\n"
"na kies hierdie opsie)."

#: kmidiframe.cpp:145
msgid "Normal Stereo"
msgstr "Normale Stereo"

#: kmidiframe.cpp:146
msgid ""
"Plays both instruments<br>\n"
"for those (sf2) patches<br>\n"
"which have two."
msgstr ""
"Speel beide instrumente<br>\n"
"vir daardie (sf2) lappe<br>\n"
"wat het twee."

#: kmidiframe.cpp:149
msgid "Extra Stereo"
msgstr "Addisionele Stereo"

#: kmidiframe.cpp:150
msgid ""
"For keyboard instruments,<br>\n"
"lower notes come from the left<br>\n"
"For other instruments, position is<br>\n"
"made a function of note<br>\n"
"velocity."
msgstr ""
"Vir sleutelbord instrumente,<br>\n"
"sagter notas kom van die links<br>\n"
"Vir ander instrumente, posisie is<br>\n"
"gemaak 'n funksie van nota<br>\n"
"snelheid."

