msgid "Surround Stereo"
msgstr "Omsingel Stereo"

#: kmidiframe.cpp:157
msgid ""
"Extra stereo, echo and"
"<br>detuned notes are spread out more<br>to left and right."
msgstr ""
"Addisionele stereo, ego en"
"<br>ontstem notas word sprei uit meer<br>na links en regterkant."

#: kmidiframe.cpp:164
msgid "Reverb"
msgstr "Reverb"

#: kmidiframe.cpp:167
msgid "Dry"
msgstr "Droog"

#: kmidiframe.cpp:168
msgid ""
"With the dry setting,<br>\n"
"after notes are released,<br>\n"
"they are ended by playing<br>\n"
"through the ends of their<br>\n"
"patches (which may cause some<br>\n"
"clicking). The wet setting makes<br>\n"
"notes continue to the ends of<br>\n"
"their volume envelopes."
msgstr ""
"Met die droog opset,<br>\n"
"na notas word gelos,<br>\n"
"hulle word geëindig deur speel<br>\n"
"deur die einde van hulle<br>\n"
"lappe (wat dalk mag veroorsaak sommige<br>\n"
"te kliek). die nat opset maak<br>\n"
"notas gaan voort na die einde van<br>\n"
"hulle volume koeverte."

